WEBVTT

00:01.240 --> 00:07.560
Sariphi, why did you suddenly ask to see 
portraits of the late king and queen?

00:07.560 --> 00:10.600
Huh? Oh, well...

00:11.560 --> 00:16.870
<i>Leonhart is half human, 
and his dad was king before him,</i>

00:17.290 --> 00:20.710
<i>so I thought he must have gotten 
his human blood from his mom.</i>

00:21.140 --> 00:24.760
Once you're queen, your picture 
will be up there, too, Sari.

00:24.760 --> 00:25.490
Huh?

00:26.260 --> 00:29.390
<i>Could I really be queen?</i>

00:34.000 --> 00:35.210
Cy!

00:35.440 --> 00:38.250
Goodness. Please excuse my discourtesy.

00:38.250 --> 00:40.630
Lady Sariphi, I presume?

00:40.920 --> 00:42.810
Oh, y-yes.

00:43.100 --> 00:45.110
I've heard so much about you.

00:45.110 --> 00:49.310
I am Vivian, Princess of Bizond.

00:49.640 --> 00:51.320
N-Nice to meet you.

00:51.760 --> 00:52.900
Be that as it may,

00:53.360 --> 00:57.390
you're even more charming than 
I expected of His Majesty's mistress.

00:57.390 --> 01:00.830
I've begun to fear for my own chances.

01:01.210 --> 01:02.490
What for?

01:02.900 --> 01:05.290
You see,

01:05.290 --> 01:08.530
I've come to ask His Majesty's 
hand in marriage.

01:09.960 --> 01:14.970
The Feline and Reptile Princesses

01:17.090 --> 01:19.230
S-Sire, please...

01:19.230 --> 01:20.880
Please calm yourself.

01:20.880 --> 01:22.220
Silence!

01:22.220 --> 01:26.850
I am your king! Who approved 
this without consulting me?!

01:27.030 --> 01:28.940
I did, Your Majesty.

01:29.400 --> 01:30.780
Anubis...

01:30.980 --> 01:35.310
Begging your pardon, but since 
Lady Sariphi's debut banquet,

01:35.310 --> 01:39.530
we have been inundated with protests 
and questions from all quarters.

01:39.870 --> 01:43.420
If you take a human queen as things stand,

01:43.420 --> 01:48.090
mending relations with the slighted 
peers may prove impossible.

01:49.510 --> 01:56.590
Naturally, I am well aware that you have 
always rejected all offers of marriage.

01:57.150 --> 01:58.000
However,

01:58.000 --> 02:01.480
if you would at least give your 
potential brides an audience...

02:01.930 --> 02:04.440
We'll never stand for it!

02:04.440 --> 02:07.030
Sariphi will be His Majesty's queen!

02:07.030 --> 02:07.940
Queen!

02:08.160 --> 02:10.310
I quite understand that, of course.

02:10.310 --> 02:11.340
However...

02:11.340 --> 02:12.970
Why, Princess Vivian.

02:13.390 --> 02:15.950
Princess Kora. And Princess Alba, too.

02:16.220 --> 02:17.570
It's been too long.

02:19.770 --> 02:21.230
Let us speak later.

02:23.230 --> 02:29.290
Each of us was sent here with the 
hopes of a nation on her shoulders.

02:29.290 --> 02:35.370
How are we to face our countrymen unless 
His Majesty at least makes us concubines?

02:36.690 --> 02:38.130
Oh, I beg your pardon.

02:38.130 --> 02:41.960
How could I discuss such things 
before our future queen?

02:42.240 --> 02:44.320
I'm so glad we had the pleasure of speaking.

02:44.790 --> 02:45.940
Now, if you'll excuse me.

02:53.450 --> 02:54.780
You startled me!

02:54.780 --> 02:57.100
You don't need to shout so loud.

02:57.100 --> 03:00.150
I wouldn't shout if you weren't so baffling.

03:00.150 --> 03:01.560
What did you just say?

03:01.890 --> 03:07.550
I said, I want you to meet these 
princesses and really talk with them.

03:07.550 --> 03:09.230
It's a waste of time.

03:09.230 --> 03:14.220
I'll never take a concubine, and I 
won't meet with these princesses.

03:14.220 --> 03:15.590
That's awful.

03:15.590 --> 03:18.180
You can't send them home 
without even seeing them.

03:18.510 --> 03:22.230
Anubis arranged this on his own initiative.

03:22.230 --> 03:24.310
I never asked for it.

03:24.760 --> 03:29.600
But I think the chancellor has a good point.

03:30.110 --> 03:34.930
You have so much trouble to deal with 
because of a human—because of me.

03:35.460 --> 03:38.310
You shouldn't upset important people 
more than you can help.

03:39.510 --> 03:43.360
Then... do you realize what it would mean

03:43.360 --> 03:48.480
if I were to humor the nobility 
and take concubines?

03:48.890 --> 03:50.100
<i>What it would mean?</i>

03:50.780 --> 03:54.110
Even I know what a concubine is, 
more or less.

03:54.620 --> 03:58.920
These are shrewd, ambitious women 
who chose a direct approach.

03:59.280 --> 04:04.090
If I keep them close, they may eventually 
threaten your place as queen.

04:05.040 --> 04:09.590
<i>If one of them would be 
more help to His Majesty...</i>

04:10.270 --> 04:11.680
I wouldn't mi—

04:14.700 --> 04:17.720
Do you honestly mean that?

04:18.770 --> 04:23.270
Well, I don't want to hold you back.

04:23.270 --> 04:29.670
Are you implying that I'm too 
weak a king to support you?

04:29.740 --> 04:30.620
<b>Hmph</b>

04:30.830 --> 04:32.530
I'm saying no such thing!

04:32.530 --> 04:33.970
You're acting weird today, sire!

04:33.970 --> 04:35.510
You're the odd one!

04:35.780 --> 04:38.720
I'm done discussing this matter with you.

04:38.720 --> 04:41.570
Shut your mouth and go to sleep!

04:42.260 --> 04:43.690
I've had it!

04:43.970 --> 04:45.890
What were you thinking?!

04:45.890 --> 04:48.750
I mean, the king is just so stubborn!

04:48.750 --> 04:54.890
B-But he'll give us a real tongue-lashing 
if he finds out we hid you.

04:54.890 --> 04:56.130
Tongue-lashing!

04:56.340 --> 05:00.260
Don't worry. His Majesty wouldn't 
lose his temper for no...

05:01.590 --> 05:03.320
<i>That's right. He wouldn't.</i>

05:03.320 --> 05:06.010
<i>So what was he so angry about earlier?</i>

05:06.630 --> 05:12.030
<i>I don't need to be queen. 
I just want to stay with him.</i>

05:12.540 --> 05:14.510
<i>Is that not good enough?</i>

05:16.830 --> 05:21.580
I think I'll have another talk 
with the king after all.

05:24.830 --> 05:31.260
I trust you realize what it means 
to set foot in my chamber.

05:31.560 --> 05:34.380
But of course, Your Majesty.

05:34.600 --> 05:36.790
I realize I'm being impertinent.

05:36.790 --> 05:40.990
But while powerful wards 
normally protect your chamber,

05:41.260 --> 05:44.270
for some reason, it is defenseless tonight.

05:44.270 --> 05:48.540
I believe I know exactly 
what that signifies.

05:49.620 --> 05:52.930
Please, don't look so fearsome.

05:52.930 --> 05:57.070
I understand how deeply Your 
Majesty cares for Lady Sariphi.

05:57.330 --> 05:58.990
But after all,

05:59.250 --> 06:01.800
Your Majesty is still a gentleman.

06:01.800 --> 06:04.800
You must require a concubine or two.

06:05.320 --> 06:11.390
I mean, you can hardly make love 
like this with a human lady, can you?

06:11.710 --> 06:16.260
<i>Do you realize what it would mean 
if I were to take a concubine?</i>

06:16.260 --> 06:18.900
<i>I know. I don't mind.</i>

06:18.900 --> 06:20.780
...you can hardly make love like this...

06:20.780 --> 06:23.980
<i>As long as I can stay with him, I don't...</i>

06:23.980 --> 06:25.900
...with a human lady...

06:27.650 --> 06:28.640
No!

06:33.300 --> 06:35.440
I... I'm sorry!

06:35.440 --> 06:36.620
I didn't mean to intrude!

06:37.030 --> 06:40.220
My, how hasty Lady Sariphi is.

06:40.220 --> 06:42.350
Now, sire, let us continue.

06:42.350 --> 06:43.340
Indeed.

06:44.110 --> 06:47.710
Due to an unwanted guest, 
I missed the one I was truly expecting.

06:48.210 --> 06:53.740
Begone. Never show your unseemly 
ambition in my presence again!

06:54.140 --> 06:56.510
B-By your leave, sire!

07:00.710 --> 07:02.070
Cy, Clops.

07:02.390 --> 07:04.680
Let me sleep here tonight, after all.

07:04.680 --> 07:06.090
Sari!

07:06.090 --> 07:07.900
I'm sorry I woke you.

07:07.900 --> 07:09.400
Come on, go back to sleep.

07:10.190 --> 07:11.960
<i>Why do I feel this way?</i>

07:11.960 --> 07:17.310
<i>It stings, like I got something 
sharp caught in my throat.</i>

07:20.210 --> 07:23.010
I never dreamed I'd one day 
share breakfast with Your Majesty.

07:23.010 --> 07:26.420
Yes, it's an incredible honor.

07:32.380 --> 07:35.140
<b>AWKWARD SILENCE</b>

07:32.870 --> 07:34.830
<i>I couldn't look him in the eye.</i>

07:36.160 --> 07:41.010
<i>I ought to be thanking him for 
meeting the princesses like this.</i>

07:41.390 --> 07:42.580
<i>And...</i>

07:42.580 --> 07:46.100
Goodness, is Princess Vivian still abed?

07:46.530 --> 07:48.400
<i>After yesterday...</i>

07:48.740 --> 07:51.840
Sire, you simply must 
visit my native kingdom.

07:51.840 --> 07:54.650
We have so many splendid works of art.

07:54.650 --> 07:58.740
Oh, if it's beauty you're after, 
my homeland is rich in currant rubies.

07:58.740 --> 08:02.200
I am dining. Still your tongues.

08:05.000 --> 08:07.870
Oh, I beg your pardon!

08:08.150 --> 08:10.180
Goodness, who's she?

08:10.180 --> 08:13.640
Amit, the sixth princess of Murga.

08:13.940 --> 08:19.190
Even those unsightly Reptilians seek 
the king's hand? How shameless.

08:19.660 --> 08:20.780
Are you all right?

08:21.370 --> 08:23.110
Did you hurt yourself?

08:23.110 --> 08:25.490
You should take in some air outside.

08:25.810 --> 08:26.690
Come on.

08:26.690 --> 08:27.660
What?!

08:27.660 --> 08:29.940
Leaving during a meal is 
the height of discourtesy!

08:29.940 --> 08:30.730
Never mind.

08:31.940 --> 08:34.030
Let her do as she pleases.

08:34.840 --> 08:37.860
Are you all right, um... Amit?

08:38.060 --> 08:42.760
P-Please forgive me, Lady Sariphi. 
I didn't mean to trouble you.

08:43.010 --> 08:45.200
Oh, I'm no one special.

08:45.590 --> 08:49.560
No, you're inspiring, Lady Sariphi!

08:49.560 --> 08:53.490
You stand your ground 
in the king's presence.

08:53.490 --> 08:58.730
I'm overcome with terror at the 
mere sight of His Majesty.

08:58.730 --> 09:00.760
Princess Amit looks a lot scarier.

09:01.140 --> 09:04.770
If you're so scared of the king, 
why ask to marry him?

09:05.260 --> 09:09.170
My homeland, Murga, is the 
foremost Reptilian kingdom.

09:09.170 --> 09:14.450
And until just 200 years ago, 
we were at war with Ozmargo.

09:14.450 --> 09:15.820
Two hundred years?

09:15.820 --> 09:19.400
Considering how long beasts live, 
that's not such ancient history.

09:19.680 --> 09:24.180
As a relatively new vassal state, 
we Reptilians face persecution.

09:24.180 --> 09:27.990
We'd assumed the king wouldn't 
even give us the time of day,

09:28.580 --> 09:33.960
but then it seemed he might have, 
um, peculiar tastes, so...

09:33.710 --> 09:35.090
<b>Peculiar tastes</b>

09:33.960 --> 09:34.820
Ah.

09:34.010 --> 09:35.090
<b>Ah</b>

09:36.480 --> 09:38.690
But it turns out I don't fit in after all.

09:39.050 --> 09:44.050
Not that he would ever have chosen me. 
All my sisters are prettier than I am.

09:44.330 --> 09:50.340
Yet I'm forbidden to return home 
without winning the king's heart,

09:50.340 --> 09:54.270
so I've essentially been exiled.

09:54.520 --> 09:56.020
That's awful!

09:56.020 --> 09:57.850
It's just how things are.

09:57.850 --> 10:01.820
Royal women must give themselves 
for their kingdoms.

10:02.320 --> 10:06.160
I was born into shackles 
I can't hope to escape.

10:06.160 --> 10:08.580
This has always been my fate.

10:10.020 --> 10:14.680
Have you heard? Our troops have 
returned from the campaign in Gael.

10:15.440 --> 10:17.350
Then the Royal Guard has returned!

10:17.980 --> 10:19.380
Look there!

10:21.450 --> 10:24.030
It's Guard Captain Jormungand!

10:25.660 --> 10:30.050
You've served well in this campaign. 
Once you've made yourself presentable—

10:30.050 --> 10:33.250
Where is the king? I must report 
the outcome of the expedition.

10:33.250 --> 10:34.180
You fool!

10:34.670 --> 10:38.530
Would you face His Majesty in 
those travel-stained clothes?!

10:38.530 --> 10:41.590
You're as uptight as ever, Abi.

10:43.020 --> 10:43.820
Hm?

10:45.980 --> 10:47.710
You must be the human princess.

10:48.170 --> 10:49.740
Your reputation precedes you.

10:50.400 --> 10:54.300
I am Jormungand, captain of 
His Majesty's Royal Guard.

10:54.940 --> 10:56.910
It is a pleasure to make your acquaintance.

10:56.910 --> 11:00.080
Th-The pleasure is mine. I'm Sariphi.

11:01.490 --> 11:04.410
I have sworn loyalty to His Majesty.

11:04.820 --> 11:09.800
If he wishes you to be his consort, 
I will abide by his decision.

11:10.140 --> 11:14.990
Still, I have my reservations 
about a human queen.

11:15.730 --> 11:18.100
Please perform your duties well,

11:18.100 --> 11:24.080
and disappoint neither 
myself nor His Majesty.

11:24.690 --> 11:26.080
Now, excuse me.

11:29.130 --> 11:31.000
I was so nervous!

11:31.000 --> 11:34.280
Captain Jormungand is a commoner 
who rose through the ranks.

11:32.580 --> 11:36.980
Wait, I refuse to accept this girl as queen!

11:34.280 --> 11:37.620
He's one of the few soldiers 
to have His Majesty's trust!

11:36.980 --> 11:38.900
Listen! Listen to me, Jor!

11:37.620 --> 11:39.030
So cool!

11:41.490 --> 11:43.320
What's wrong, Amit?

11:43.320 --> 11:45.810
Oh, nothing. Only...

11:46.140 --> 11:53.640
Whenever I see the captain, 
w-well, my heart skips a beat.

11:54.720 --> 11:55.730
Are you sick?!

11:55.730 --> 11:57.230
I don't think so.

11:57.710 --> 12:02.000
You see, it all started 
when I was a little girl,

12:02.000 --> 12:07.980
during the first royal visit to Murga 
since we became a vassal state.

12:08.430 --> 12:12.360
Everyone in Murga was eager 
for a glimpse of the young king.

12:12.360 --> 12:13.720
And I...

12:13.720 --> 12:15.300
Out of the way, Amit!

12:15.300 --> 12:18.090
I <i>must</i> get His Majesty 
to see me in this dress!

12:18.090 --> 12:19.080
Just then...

12:19.770 --> 12:20.770
Use this.

12:21.100 --> 12:24.770
Th-This is a Royal Guard scarf!

12:24.770 --> 12:29.810
It has the royal seal to show you 
take orders only from His Majesty!

12:29.810 --> 12:32.760
I can't accept something so precious!

12:32.760 --> 12:36.950
His Majesty wishes his Royal 
Guard to defend his kingdom.

12:37.430 --> 12:44.270
Every scrap of cloth I wear and drop of 
blood in my veins belongs to its people.

12:44.980 --> 12:50.410
That was Captain Jormungand, although 
he was a common guardsman at the time.

12:51.150 --> 12:53.710
What a man!

12:53.710 --> 12:55.790
I only met him that one time,

12:56.190 --> 13:00.470
so I doubt he even remembers me.

13:00.470 --> 13:05.170
But I longed to see him again 
and return his scarf.

13:05.910 --> 13:08.760
And that's why you came to woo the king?

13:09.230 --> 13:11.730
Even I think I'm a fool.

13:12.170 --> 13:18.740
But I don't care how miserable 
I end up if I can go to his side.

13:18.740 --> 13:21.560
That's what love is.

13:23.220 --> 13:26.920
Love, huh? I guess I 
don't really understand.

13:26.920 --> 13:31.330
Oh, don't worry. You'll know 
when your time comes.

13:32.560 --> 13:34.260
It's like the ringing of a bell.

13:34.260 --> 13:40.590
Your heart starts racing to 
tell you that he's the one.

13:40.890 --> 13:42.450
Do you not know such a person?

13:42.450 --> 13:45.560
Someone who makes your cheeks 
hot upon merely seeing him,

13:45.560 --> 13:48.140
and whose voice makes you tingle?

13:48.780 --> 13:55.450
And the sight of him becoming intimate 
with another woman makes your heart ache?

13:56.500 --> 13:58.310
I take it you've thought of someone?

13:59.410 --> 14:00.950
I'm not sure.

14:00.950 --> 14:02.930
We're kind of fighting right now.

14:02.930 --> 14:04.930
Oh, dear! That absolutely won't do!

14:04.930 --> 14:06.940
You need to make up as soon as you can!

14:07.250 --> 14:12.140
No matter how much your heart aches, 
you mustn't ignore how you feel.

14:12.140 --> 14:18.490
Stand your ground, confront him, 
and tell him frankly how you feel.

14:18.770 --> 14:19.660
Um...

14:19.660 --> 14:22.760
I understand! Your love is a 
secret from the king, isn't it?!

14:22.760 --> 14:25.910
Have no fear! I'm on your side!

14:25.910 --> 14:27.030
Well...

14:27.030 --> 14:30.140
From this day forth, we are the 
League of Maidens in Love!

14:30.140 --> 14:34.030
Sari's overwhelmed. I don't really 
get it, but I'm impressed.

14:31.210 --> 14:33.680
Please say it with me! Ready?

14:33.680 --> 14:35.850
We are the League of Maidens in Love!

14:34.030 --> 14:35.060
Scary.

14:34.640 --> 14:35.850
...In love.

14:36.440 --> 14:37.100
Once more!

14:36.980 --> 14:41.600
What is that Reptilian princess thinking, 
fawning over the human?

14:37.100 --> 14:39.700
We are the League of Maidens in Love!

14:41.600 --> 14:43.920
Since she can't win the king's affection,

14:43.920 --> 14:46.320
she must mean to curry favor 
with the human instead.

14:46.320 --> 14:50.230
What base cunning. 
She needs to learn her place.

14:51.210 --> 14:54.910
Cy, Clops, do I really need to attend, too?

14:55.180 --> 14:56.660
Of course you do!

14:56.660 --> 15:01.160
His Majesty is holding a banquet 
to recognize Captain Jor tonight!

15:01.160 --> 15:04.060
And the festivities can't 
start without our queen!

15:04.060 --> 15:04.680
Huh?

15:05.090 --> 15:07.600
What's wrong, Amit?

15:07.600 --> 15:09.080
The banquet's about to...

15:10.770 --> 15:14.060
Your dress is in shreds! 
How did this happen?!

15:14.060 --> 15:16.360
W-Well, you see...

15:17.980 --> 15:21.820
My, Reptilian formal wear is quite daring.

15:21.820 --> 15:24.010
Don't tell me <i>you</i> did this!

15:24.010 --> 15:25.850
It's all right, Lady Sariphi.

15:25.850 --> 15:26.810
But tonight is...

15:27.530 --> 15:32.700
I know. Captain Jormungand 
will attend this banquet.

15:33.240 --> 15:38.330
I had dreamed that I might 
share a word with him.

15:39.040 --> 15:43.580
But the worlds we live in 
are just too far apart.

15:44.110 --> 15:47.170
This is my punishment for 
having ideas above my station.

15:47.630 --> 15:47.670
<b>YANK</b>

15:47.670 --> 15:47.710
<b>YANK</b>

15:47.710 --> 15:47.750
<b>YANK</b>

15:47.750 --> 15:47.800
<b>YANK</b>

15:47.800 --> 15:48.550
<b>YANK</b>

15:48.540 --> 15:50.720
L-L-Lady Sariphi?!

15:50.720 --> 15:52.300
It is <i>not</i> all right!

15:52.300 --> 15:55.690
You came all this way to see 
the captain, didn't you?

15:55.940 --> 15:58.560
Then don't let a little 
thing like this beat you.

15:58.560 --> 16:01.300
You want to be with him, no matter what.

16:01.600 --> 16:04.330
Isn't that what love is?

16:05.380 --> 16:12.040
We honor the safe return and illustrious 
achievements of Captain Jormungand.

16:14.010 --> 16:17.620
Girl, what became of the formal 
wear I had prepared for you?

16:17.620 --> 16:19.830
The hem caught on something and ripped.

16:19.830 --> 16:22.780
What?! And you had the gall to come anyway?

16:25.500 --> 16:29.870
Say, I don't see Princess Amit.

16:29.870 --> 16:32.720
She's probably too busy 
deciding what to wear.

16:33.850 --> 16:36.610
I... I'm so sorry for my lateness.

16:39.350 --> 16:41.180
U-Um...

16:42.300 --> 16:43.760
<i>Oh, I can't!</i>

16:43.760 --> 16:45.400
<i>I'm hopeless.</i>

16:45.400 --> 16:47.100
<i>You can do it, Amit!</i>

16:47.750 --> 16:51.020
I promise. If you can work up 
your courage, then...

16:54.580 --> 16:55.730
For you.

16:57.170 --> 16:58.320
Is this...

17:02.850 --> 17:06.240
I hardly recognized you, my little lady.

17:08.350 --> 17:10.380
<i>Way to go, Amit.</i>

17:10.900 --> 17:13.030
<i>I'll be brave, too.</i>

17:11.260 --> 17:12.150
Here you are.

17:12.150 --> 17:13.260
Oh, thank you.

17:13.670 --> 17:16.290
<i>I'll face these feelings I can't name.</i>

17:19.300 --> 17:20.680
<i>Vivian...</i>

17:21.160 --> 17:24.710
<i>I thought she looked at me just now. 
Maybe I imagined it?</i>

17:26.660 --> 17:28.690
<i>I feel... dizzy...</i>

17:34.930 --> 17:37.700
Huh? What am I doing here?

17:38.180 --> 17:40.410
How do you feel?

17:40.810 --> 17:44.610
It appears you were suddenly taken ill.

17:45.340 --> 17:46.930
I'm fine now.

17:46.930 --> 17:49.710
Really? That's a shame.

17:50.230 --> 17:53.800
Perhaps I should have 
presented stronger liquor.

17:55.090 --> 17:59.430
Say, would you kindly make way for me?

17:59.430 --> 18:00.520
Huh?

18:00.530 --> 18:02.170
Um... What do you—

18:02.170 --> 18:02.900
Be quiet!

18:03.190 --> 18:07.940
I've controlled all manner 
of men with my body.

18:07.940 --> 18:12.530
Yet the king refused to so much as touch me!

18:13.070 --> 18:15.630
I've never been so humiliated!

18:15.630 --> 18:21.970
Royal women are scorned as wastes of 
space unless they're politically useful.

18:21.970 --> 18:23.290
I won't stand for it!

18:23.650 --> 18:28.730
The idiot king who fell for a human 
is the truly worthless one!

18:28.730 --> 18:31.800
What is he good for, except as my puppet?!

18:31.800 --> 18:34.790
So... just disappear!

18:36.100 --> 18:39.990
Even if I weren't here,

18:39.990 --> 18:43.570
I know His Majesty would 
never keep you by his side.

18:45.050 --> 18:48.600
The king just isn't that kind of person.

18:49.310 --> 18:54.150
You see, he suffers under the weight 
of his authority more than anyone.

18:54.510 --> 18:58.600
But he tries to hide that from 
everyone and be a strong king.

18:58.600 --> 19:01.040
He does it for all his people.

19:01.510 --> 19:04.230
And because His Majesty is like that,

19:04.850 --> 19:09.830
even if I can't be his queen, 
I'll never stand aside for you!

19:10.890 --> 19:12.160
Why, you...

19:12.160 --> 19:14.290
Run, Lady Sariphi! Hurry!

19:16.480 --> 19:17.590
Amit!

19:20.070 --> 19:23.070
Even the Reptilian stands in my way?

19:23.070 --> 19:25.840
You lesser races never know when to stop!

19:33.040 --> 19:34.140
Sire!

19:36.100 --> 19:39.330
Have you forgotten what I said last night?

19:39.330 --> 19:41.920
P-Please forgive me!

19:41.920 --> 19:45.160
B-But I had no other choice.

19:45.670 --> 19:49.320
I can't survive without 
Your Majesty's affection.

19:49.320 --> 19:51.530
I beg you, please have mercy!

19:51.530 --> 19:52.810
Silence!

19:52.810 --> 19:54.330
This is your final warning!

19:54.330 --> 19:57.710
Never show your hideous self 
in my presence again!

20:03.430 --> 20:04.980
Are you all right?

20:06.120 --> 20:07.820
That spoiled the evening.

20:08.220 --> 20:12.100
You needn't return to the banquet. 
Rest in my chamber.

20:12.580 --> 20:13.360
Sire.

20:15.040 --> 20:19.380
Thank you for taking the 
time to meet them all.

20:19.820 --> 20:23.530
And I'm sorry. This is all my fault.

20:23.890 --> 20:26.280
This banquet was my idea.

20:26.280 --> 20:32.660
Anubis insists I humor the nobility 
occasionally. I merely saw his point.

20:32.920 --> 20:38.330
And... I spoke too harshly 
last night. Forgive me.

20:43.040 --> 20:48.420
So in the end, none of the princesses 
managed to move the king's heart.

20:48.660 --> 20:53.760
Oh, my, Lord Chancellor. 
What brings you to the palace outskirts?

20:53.760 --> 20:56.060
Wh-Why, Princess Amit.

20:56.060 --> 20:58.270
What are <i>you</i> still doing here?

20:58.940 --> 21:05.790
I received special permission 
to stay on as Lady Sariphi's friend.

21:06.150 --> 21:09.630
His Majesty called it my 
reward for defending her.

21:09.630 --> 21:10.780
<i>What?!</i>

21:11.090 --> 21:14.460
I baked mandragora scones 
for a late-night snack.

21:14.460 --> 21:16.680
Would you care for one?

21:16.680 --> 21:18.660
N-No, thank you.

21:18.980 --> 21:21.030
I see. Then excuse me.

21:22.130 --> 21:26.590
<i>All I've done is give 
the wench another ally!</i>

21:27.910 --> 21:33.000
Sariphi, you needn't pity 
or sympathize with her.

21:33.000 --> 21:38.430
Princesses Amit, Vivian, and the rest 
all knew the risks of what they did.

21:38.720 --> 21:42.550
I know. I need to be more prepared, too.

21:43.120 --> 21:46.610
<i>For what it means to stay by the king's side.</i>

21:47.440 --> 21:49.080
Then remember this:

21:50.060 --> 21:53.390
I need neither concubines 
nor any other women.

21:54.160 --> 21:58.290
The only woman I desire is you, Sariphi.

22:00.620 --> 22:01.800
<i>A bell.</i>

22:01.800 --> 22:03.460
<i>It's like the ringing of a bell,</i>

22:03.460 --> 22:09.000
<i>telling you that he's the one.</i>

22:09.000 --> 22:09.870
Huh?

22:12.010 --> 22:14.340
Sari, what's come over you?

22:14.340 --> 22:17.520
It's cold out today! 
And you're so fluffy, sire!

22:17.810 --> 22:19.800
The weather seems ordinary to me.

22:20.110 --> 22:21.840
<i>I don't get it.</i>

22:21.840 --> 22:23.080
Well, no matter.

22:24.040 --> 22:26.150
Stay that way as long as you like.

22:27.530 --> 22:29.610
<i>Maybe I'll figure it out someday,</i>

22:30.670 --> 22:33.770
<i>if I can stay beside this warmth.</i>

23:25.480 --> 23:27.510
Curse you, human wench!

23:27.510 --> 23:29.660
You turn my every ploy against me!

23:29.660 --> 23:31.690
If this continues, my position will—

23:31.690 --> 23:34.520
What?! What is this strange menace I sense?!

23:34.520 --> 23:38.120
Would you care for a scone, Lord Chancellor?

23:36.970 --> 23:39.970
Next Episode

23:36.970 --> 23:39.970
The Holy Beast of Immortality and Rebirth

23:38.120 --> 23:39.640
No, thank you.
